  Tutorial:
  - PopupId: WaveExplanation
    Title: Defend the Main Base
    Instructions: Complete onboarding, prepare your defenses, then select Start wave.
      Ships approach from different water routes and can attack towers as they pass.
      Later waves increase enemy strength. Protect the Main Base to continue.
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: CommanderMode
    Title: Movement and controls
    Instructions: 'Press A for commander overview: map left, management right. Movement
      and turning remain available. Select a card and press the right trigger on
      a valid cell to build. Select a tower to show its range on both maps and to
      upgrade, repair or sell. Right grip cancels a build; A closes overview.'
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: BuyTower
    Title: The management panel
    Instructions: Left stick moves. Right stick turns. B jumps; press again in the
      air to double jump. A opens commander overview, X toggles the main panel, and
      Y toggles the map on your right controller. Right trigger selects. Right grip
      cancels construction.
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: InsufficientMoney
    Title: Three separate resources
    Instructions: This action needs more Money or Upgrade Points. Inspect the option
      to see its exact requirement. Unavailable actions do not spend resources.
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: PlaceFoundation
    Title: Build a foundation
    Instructions: 'Choose a Navy foundation, point at a green ocean cell, and press
      the right trigger to place it. Keep shipping lanes clear. Normal foundations
      have no range bonus; medium gives 1.25x and high gives 1.75x. Right grip cancels
      without spending Money.

      In physical mode the panel hides when you choose
      a build item. You can move while placing. X opens the panel again.'
    Task: 1
  - PopupId: PlaceTower
    Title: Build your first turret
    Instructions: 'Choose a tower, point at a compatible empty foundation, and press
      the right trigger to build. Preview colors show valid and occupied cells. Money
      is spent only for a valid placement.

      In physical mode the panel hides
      when you choose a build item. You can move while placing. X opens the panel
      again.'
    Task: 2
  - PopupId: UpgradeTower
    Title: Two kinds of upgrades
    Instructions: Global upgrades spend Upgrade Points and unlock higher tiers for
      future purchases. Rank requirements still apply. Select a placed tower and
      Upgrade to improve only that tower using its displayed individual cost. Its
      foundation and health percentage stay attached.
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: RankExplanation
    Title: Navy ranks
    Instructions: Your Navy rank and EXP progress are in the panel header. Defeat
      ships and clear waves to earn EXP. Promotion unlocks catalog options and grants
      Upgrade Points.
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: SellTower
    Title: Selling versus destruction
    Instructions: Select a tower, choose Sell, and confirm the displayed Money refund.
      Sell a mounted tower before selling its foundation.
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: RepairTower
    Title: Repair damaged structures
    Instructions: Select a damaged tower and choose Repair. The displayed Money cost
      restores its health. Full-health towers cannot be repaired.
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: Minimap
    Title: One battlefield, two views
    Instructions: Look at your right controller for the live minimap and Main Base
      health. Y hides or shows this map. A opens commander overview. Map symbols
      show you, the base, structures and enemy ships.
    Task: 0
  - PopupId: WaveExplanation
    Title: Prepare and start wave 1
    Instructions: Complete onboarding, prepare your defenses, then select Start wave.
      Ships approach from different water routes and can attack towers as they pass.
      Later waves increase enemy strength. Protect the Main Base to continue.
    Task: 0
